{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_978019507#4_1907983876","relevance":1,"reason":"The result is related because it mentions video capture as a tool for teacher self-reflection on instruction, coaching, evidence of student engagement, and sharing teaching ideas. However, it appears to be a product or technology page rather than a document dedicated to why teachers should review their instruction.","learned":"Video/audio capture can support teachers reviewing instruction by providing evidence for self-reflection, student engagement, observation, coaching, and peer idea exchange."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"teacher self-assessment\" (+ importance benefits) (+ improve effective) (+ instruction teaching) students)","reason":"Search a more focused self-assessment formulation to find dedicated sources explaining why teachers should evaluate their own instruction to become more effective and support students."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"teacher self-assessment\" (+ importance benefits) (+ improve effective) (+ instruction teaching) students)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1004064348#0_2084570869","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q558","rank":1,"snippet":"the same things in the same way, to teach the same concepts the same way, and to use the same exercises again and again. Guess what? If a teacher does the same things the same way he or she has always done them, the results are going to be the same that they have always been in the past. Some teachers are pleased with their results and have the attitude that they do not need to change any of their teaching practices. However, for those teachers that are overachievers, it is imperative that they reflect on what they taught, how they taught certain concepts, and how effective their <cover>teaching/instructional strategies were. Self-Assessment Leads to Improvement Once teachers begin the evaluation process, they will see in which areas they can improve. How can I make the concept of _______ stick in my students’ heads?\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"The Importance of Teacher Self-Assessment: </cover>The First Step in Implementing A Teacher Improvement Plan - BrightHub Education\" , \"url\": \"http://www.brighthubeducation.com/teaching-methods-tips/15761-importance-of-teacher-self-assessment/\" }"}}
{"request":{"judgments":"17/50"}}
{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1004064348#0_2084570869","relevance":3,"reason":"The BrightHub Education article is directly titled 'The Importance of Teacher Self-Assessment' and explains why teachers should review instruction: if teachers keep doing the same things they get the same results, so they should reflect on what and how they taught and how effective their instructional strategies were; self-assessment then reveals areas for improvement.","learned":"Teachers should review instruction to avoid stagnant routines, evaluate the effectiveness of instructional strategies, and identify areas where they can improve student understanding."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q558","reason":"The self-assessment query produced a directly relevant grade-3 result; continue to see whether the result list contains more dedicated evidence on teacher review and improvement."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q558"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1004064348#2_2084575126","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q558","rank":3,"snippet":"more complete understanding of that particular concept. Becoming a more effective teacher does not mean that a teacher passes more students or that a teacher raises their class average by so many points. To be more <cover>effective simply suggests that a teacher challenges and enlightens his/her students each and every day. Extend Self-Assessement to Other Areas Not only does this period of self-reflection extend to teaching, but it can be extended to how teachers manage their classrooms? Do you go home every day with a pounding headache because your students are noisy? Do you have the loudest classroom on the hall? If so, it is time to make some changes. A teacher can do several things differently to maintain order. If a teacher is unsure of what changes to implement, ask some more experienced teachers, and theywill be full of ideas.\" , \"start_char\": 1462.000000 , \"title\": \"The Importance of Teacher Self-Assessment: </cover>The First Step in Implementing A Teacher Improvement Plan - BrightHub Education\" , \"url\": \"http://www.brighthubeducation.com/teaching-methods-tips/15761-importance-of-teacher-self-assessment/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1004064348#1_2084573064","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
