{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_506102743#3_1032621383","relevance":1,"reason":"The result is a Praxis study-guide page that only lists reflective practice for professional growth as part of a test topic. It is related to teacher reflection but does not explain why teachers should review their instruction.","learned":"Reflective practice is commonly categorized as part of teacher professional development and professional growth, but test-prep pages are not useful evidence."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"reflection in teaching\" (+ important importance benefits) teachers (+ improve teaching learning students))","reason":"Search a broader wording for 'reflection in teaching' plus importance/benefits and improvement terms to find distinct dedicated articles explaining why teachers should review instruction."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"reflection in teaching\" (+ important importance benefits) teachers (+ improve teaching learning students))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_34_1309807022#21_2717505203","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q566","rank":1,"snippet":"students Reflection question about assessment and grading Reflection questions about classroom management Reflection questions for teachers’ professional development \" , \"segment\": \"Get your heads together. As a group, identify if any of these “themes” you wrote down occur several times. Make a top 5 of the group. Now you have a list with qualities, skills or attitudes you want to adopt or get out the way as a teacher yourself. 20 reflection questions for teachers In the reflection approaches above, you’ll already find some reflection resources for <cover>teachers. And of course, there’s more. I listed some other important question prompts you can ask yourself when reflecting on your teaching abilities. The reflection questions are divided in different categories: Reflection questions to ask with students Did this lesson help you understand other lessons better? Why?\" , \"start_char\": 8235.000000 , \"title\": \"How to become a reflective teacher - The complete guide for reflection in teaching - </cover>BookWidgets\" , \"url\": \"https://www.bookwidgets.com/blog/2019/02/how-to-become-a-reflective-teacher-the-complete-guide-for-reflection-in-teaching\" }"}}
